# Owner rule (D-001, D-035): no Space-Track data may ever enter this repository.
# Guard placed before any Space-Track account exists. Matches any path component containing
# "space-track", "space_track", "space track", "space.track" or "spacetrack" in any letter case.
*[Ss][Pp][Aa][Cc][Ee][-_ .][Tt][Rr][Aa][Cc][Kk]*
*[Ss][Pp][Aa][Cc][Ee][Tt][Rr][Aa][Cc][Kk]*
**/spacetrack/
**/space-track/
**/space_track/

